    <briefdescription>
<para>Field Diagnostics Collector - Thread-Safe Event Collection. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="version"><para>0.0.1 </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="note"><para>Maturity: 🟢 PRODUCTION-READY</para>
</simplesect>
Central collection point for structured diagnostic events from all ThemisDB modules. Handles thread-safe buffering, PII masking, and integration with Prometheus metrics.</para>
<para>Design:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Singleton pattern for process-wide collection</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Mutex-protected deque buffer (std::shared_mutex for concurrent reads, exclusive lock for writes/eviction)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Automatic PII masking before emission</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Optional async batch export to observability backend</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>&lt;1% CPU overhead target</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Usage: <programlisting filename=".cpp"><codeline><highlight class="keyword">auto</highlight><highlight class="normal">&amp;<sp/>collector<sp/>=<sp/>FieldDiagnosticsCollector::getInstance();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">DiagnosticEvent<sp/>evt{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.timestamp<sp/>=<sp/>std::chrono::system_clock::now(),</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.failure_category<sp/>=<sp/>DiagnosticFailureCategory::NLI_INFERENCE,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.module_name<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;rag&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.error_message<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Model<sp/>inference<sp/>failed&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.severity_level<sp/>=<sp/>DiagnosticSeverity::ERROR,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.deployment_environment<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;production&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>.version<sp/>=<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;1.5.0&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">};</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">collector.emitWithPIIMasking(evt);</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
